<h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
<p>By accessing and using [COMPANY NAME] Rentals ("Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms"). If you do not agree to these Terms, please do not use the Service.</p>

<h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
<p>[COMPANY NAME] operates an online catalog of rental items (tables, chairs, decor) for events including weddings, birthdays, anniversaries, corporate gatherings, and other celebrations. Customers can browse the catalog, submit rental requests, and receive quotes and confirmations via email.</p>

<h2>3. Eligible Users</h2>
<ul>
  <li>You must be at least 18 years old to use this Service</li>
  <li>You must have the legal authority to enter into a rental contract</li>
  <li>You agree to provide accurate, current, and complete information when making requests</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Rental Request & Quotes</h2>

<h3>4.1 How Requests Work</h3>
<p>When you submit a rental request through our catalog:</p>
<ol>
  <li>You select items and quantities</li>
  <li>You provide your name, email, event type, and event date</li>
  <li>We receive your request and send a confirmation email</li>
  <li>An admin will review and send you a formal quote via email</li>
  <li>No contract exists until the admin confirms your request</li>
</ol>

<h3>4.2 Quotes & Binding Offers</h3>
<p>Our quotes are non-binding estimates based on current pricing. A binding rental contract is formed only when:</p>
<ul>
  <li>We send you a formal order confirmation via email, AND</li>
  <li>You accept the terms and total price in that confirmation</li>
</ul>

<h3>4.3 Pricing</h3>
<p>All prices are in USD and subject to change. Quotes are valid for 30 days unless otherwise stated. Rental costs include:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Item rental fees (per unit price × quantity)</li>
  <li>Cleaning fee (if applicable and items are selected)</li>
  <li>Delivery fee (if delivery is included; otherwise pickup only)</li>
</ul>

<p>Taxes and any additional fees will be clearly stated in the confirmation email.</p>

<h2>5. Rental Conditions</h2>

<h3>5.1 Rental Period</h3>
<p>The rental period begins on your event date at the time specified in your confirmation and ends the following business day at 5:00 PM (or as agreed). Delivery and setup are included if selected.</p>

<h3>5.2 Condition of Items</h3>
<p>Rental items are provided in good working condition. You agree to:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Inspect items upon delivery and report any damage immediately</li>
  <li>Return items in the same condition as received (normal wear and tear excepted)</li>
  <li>Pay for any damage beyond normal wear and tear</li>
</ul>

<h3>5.3 Liability & Damage</h3>
<p>You are responsible for any damage to rental items while in your possession. Damage charges will be:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Minor (small stains, scuffs):</strong> $0–$25 per item</li>
  <li><strong>Moderate (broken parts, significant damage):</strong> $25–$100 per item</li>
  <li><strong>Severe (item unusable):</strong> Full replacement cost</li>
</ul>

<p>We will assess damage and notify you via email within 48 hours of return. You will receive an invoice for any damage charges.</p>

<h2>6. Payment Terms</h2>

<h3>6.1 Payment Method</h3>
<p>Payment is processed through a secure payment system specified in your confirmation email. We accept:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Credit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express)</li>
  <li>Bank transfers (on request)</li>
</ul>

<h3>6.2 Timing</h3>
<p>Full payment is due before the rental period begins. If payment is not received, we reserve the right to cancel your reservation.</p>

<h3>6.3 Refunds & Cancellations</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Cancellation 60+ days before event:</strong> Full refund</li>
  <li><strong>Cancellation 30-59 days before event:</strong> 75% refund</li>
  <li><strong>Cancellation 15-29 days before event:</strong> 50% refund</li>
  <li><strong>Cancellation less than 15 days before event:</strong> No refund</li>
</ul>

<p>Refunds are processed within 5-7 business days to your original payment method.</p>

<h2>7. Cancellation & Rescheduling</h2>

<h3>7.1 Cancellation by Customer</h3>
<p>You may cancel your rental by emailing us at [EMAIL ADDRESS]. Your cancellation is effective upon receipt. Refunds are subject to the schedule in Section 6.3.</p>

<h3>7.2 Cancellation by [COMPANY NAME]</h3>
<p>We may cancel your rental if:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Payment is not received by the due date</li>
  <li>You breach these Terms or provide false information</li>
  <li>We experience unforeseen circumstances (natural disaster, illness, etc.) that make delivery impossible</li>
</ul>

<p>In cases of cancellation by us due to circumstances beyond our control, we will provide a full refund and reasonable notice.</p>

<h3>7.3 Rescheduling</h3>
<p>You may reschedule your event to a different date at no additional cost, subject to availability. Contact us at least 30 days before your original event date.</p>

<h2>8. Delivery & Pickup</h2>

<h3>8.1 Delivery Service</h3>
<p>If delivery is included in your quote, we will deliver items to your specified address on your event date. Delivery times are estimated and not guaranteed.</p>

<h3>8.2 Setup & Takedown</h3>
<p>If setup/takedown is included, our team will arrange items according to your specifications (if time allows). You are responsible for directing our team and managing the venue.</p>

<h3>8.3 Pickup</h3>
<p>Rental items must be returned by 5:00 PM the day after your event or as specified in your confirmation. If you arrange pickup yourself, items must be returned to our facility by the specified date/time.</p>

<h3>8.4 Delivery Area</h3>
<p>We deliver within [XX] miles of [CITY]. Deliveries outside this area require a quote for additional mileage fees.</p>

